  "scope": "C328 carries exact16-byte quote-lane mask and block pointer per Csv cursor across existing generic field() searches, filtering lanes before current p. Avoids overlapping SIMD rereads on escaped pairs/nearby fields; full raw canonical keys, decoded lengths/actual decode, numeric/country/owner/name/pipeline/default/flags/PGO remain. Full classifier loads are bounded, mask shifts max60NEON/15SSE, scalar tail unchanged. New per-instance private scanner state has no shared mutation. This is ordinary computed input-token state, no result/seed catalogue/counter/harness/host change. No claim of gain/general correctness before fresh models/main/strict/race/GCC/image/default/all29 and real board if warranted.",
